<title>USA: AMEX closing averages.</title>
<headline>AMEX closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the American Stock Exchange closed mixed in heavy trading.</p>
<p>The Amex Composite index fell 0.67 to 640.39.</p>
<p>The average price per share was down $0.01.</p>
<p>Advances beat declines 283 to 277.</p>
<p>Preliminary volume 22,044,040 was compared with 24,818,945 on Wednesday.</p>
<p>(Prices official as of 1630 EDT/2030 GMT)</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1830))</p>
